role": "user", "content": "which type of surgery will cover under my policy"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "Your Health Shield Basic policy covers inpatient surgeries and over 200 listed day-care procedures, such as cataract surgery, chemotherapy, and arthroscopic surgeries. However, specific ailments like hernia, piles, and elective joint replacements are subject to a 24-month waiting period or are excluded. Please note that your policy is currently suspended, so you must clear the overdue premium to ensure these benefits are active. Is there anything else you can help with?"}]', '[]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, TRUE, NULL, NULL, NULL, '["escalation", "human_requested", "frustrated"]', NULL, '{"session_id": "a53bb4f2-8fb9-4b37-a1f5-0d3d4d30bda4", "escalated_at": "2026-09-02T06:10:10.765750+00:00"}', '2026-09-02T06:10:10.752423+00:00', NULL) ON CONFLICT ("appointment_id") DO NOTHING;
