Rs.25 Lakhs and jewellery up to Rs.10 Lakhs. To file a claim, you must first report the incident to the police and obtain a First Information Report, then contact us immediately to initiate the claim process. Is there anything else you need help with?"}]', '[]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, TRUE, NULL, NULL, NULL, '["escalation", "human_requested", "frustrated"]', NULL, '{"session_id": "2b82427a-2ad1-4819-8a6c-cd91e1670159", "escalated_at": "2026-09-04T08:07:00.549724+00:00"}', '2026-09-04T08:07:00.504403+00:00', NULL) ON CONFLICT ("appointment_id") DO NOTHING;
