um electronics, jewellery, art collections, and complete peace of mind requirements. This plan covers everything in the Basic plan and significantly extends protection to include jewellery, global contents cover, rent-loss liability, gadget cover, and a superior reinstatement value basis for all settlements."}], "customer_id": "9b121278-c52d-4e14-821a-89b97dbf7d90", "passage_count": 4}', 'success', 125, '2026-09-04T08:05:41.005514+00:00') ON CONFLICT ("exec_id") DO NOTHING;
