son", "content": "[Health Shield Gold — Coverage Details]\nce per year for a different illness, annual health check-up up to ₹2,500, and ambulance up to ₹5,000. Zero co-payment. 24-month PED waiting period."}, {"score": 0.612, "title": "Health Shield Premium — Coverage Details", "domain": "health_insurance", "source": "health_shield_plans_kb.json", "content": "Question: What does Health Shield Premium cover that Gold does not?\nAnswer: Premium adds: OPD/outpatient coverage (₹15,000/year), mental health and psychiatric hospitalization, unlimited sum insured restoration (even for same illness), Critical Illness lump sum (₹5L on diagnosis), international emergency cover (₹10L), air ambulance (₹3L), HIV treatment, global medical second opinion, sum insured up to ₹1 Crore, and shortest PED waiting period of 12 months."}], "customer_id": "f15c45e9-9d47-4364-a95c-0586bf48f9b7", "passage_count": 4}', 'success', 125, '2026-09-03T08:35:09.606187+00:00') ON CONFLICT ("exec_id") DO NOTHING;
