 insured up to ₹1 Crore, and shortest PED waiting period of 12 months."}, {"score": 0.751, "title": "Health Shield Gold — Coverage Details", "domain": "health_insurance", "source": "health_shield_plans_kb.json", "content": "Question: What does Health Shield Gold cover?\nAnswer: Gold covers: inpatient hospitalization (Private AC Room, no sub-limit), ICU at 100%, 60-day pre-hospitalization, 90-day post-hospitalization, 540+ day care procedures, maternity (₹75K normal/₹1L C-section after 24 months), newborn from Day 1, AYUSH, ambulance ₹5,000, annual check-up, and 100% sum insured restoration. Zero co-pay, sum insured up to ₹10L."}], "customer_id": "94089473-eaf1-46dc-8734-9a5f0f668ed3", "passage_count": 4}', 'success', 172, '2026-09-17T19:12:29.412209+00:00') ON CONFLICT ("exec_id") DO NOTHING;
